    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automation Pattern\n\n**PATTERN: Import → Validate → Transform → Notify**\n\n**PURPOSE:**\nStandard workflow for data processing that ensures data quality and team visibility\n\n**STEPS:**\n1. Import: Receive or fetch data from source\n2. Validate: Check data meets requirements\n3. Transform: Calculate and enrich data\n4. Notify: Alert team of results\n\n**BENEFITS:**\n* Consistent data processing\n* Early error detection\n* Audit trail through notifications\n* Clear separation of concerns",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "4e94b0cb-f9d9-43b9-a8f6-1d0339c1343a",
      "name": "Pattern Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -672,
        352
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Validation Logic\n\n**IF NODE:**\n* Checks multiple conditions\n* Routes to TRUE or FALSE path\n* Combines with AND/OR logic\n\n**THIS EXAMPLE:**\n* Amount must be > 0\n* Customer ID must not be empty\n* Both must be true (AND)\n\n**FAILURE HANDLING:**\n* FALSE path goes to error notification\n* TRUE path continues processing\n* Prevents bad data from propagating",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "fa2c4938-8851-4cb8-a72c-01118374f2b6",
      "name": "Validation Details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -256,
        352
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Exercise\n\n**TASK:**\n1. Add validation for currency field (must be USD)\n2. Add tax to the transform (7% of amount)\n3. Include tax amount in notification message\n4. Test with valid and invalid data\n\n**SUCCESS CRITERIA:**\n✓ Invalid currency triggers error path\n✓ Tax calculated correctly\n✓ Both notifications work",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "587eea92-c44c-414b-9706-7ac83589e985",
      "name": "Exercise",
